  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for Offshore Sandsourcing in Vietnam</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Ministry of Natural Resources and Environment of Vietnam has been tasked with exploring offshore sand sourcing in areas off the coast of the Mekong Delta. Through the Strategic Partnership Arrangement on Water and Climate Adaptation, the Ministry has asked support of the Dutch government in helping with both the technical and the environmental aspects of this activity.</narrative>
  </description>
